  "behavior": [
    "Caches and documents admit calls only on their creating language thread. Same-cache documents share mutation; clone is independent.",
    "Cache remove/reset/close retain independently owned documents, including close during resource-provider callbacks.",
    "Provider exceptions preserve the original language error, invalidate callback outputs, do not populate cache, and allow retry.",
    "String/bytes/Buffer prefixes use exact byte lengths; default -1 uses full input, excessive size clamps, other negatives reject before native entry.",
    "RGBA stride validation preserves Buffer length/padding. Native owned Texture retains the engine after drawing ends; checked Unit reports Busy until close."
